     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Hello,<br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">I have made an update to v0.62.0. This version is now available on CRAN, as well, which can be downloaded simply by typing &quot;install.packages(&#39;brainGraph&#39;)&quot;.<br><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">There is a new function, called &quot;SPM&quot;, which replaces both &quot;group.graph.diffs&quot; and &quot;permute.vertex&quot;. I am currently updating the User Guide (Chapter 5.12) to reflect these changes and show examples.<br><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">For specific changes, see on <a href=\"https://github.com/cwatson/brainGraph/commit/a2748e9880568d220b0670d082f56dbb3dbae8e6?short_path=8312ad0#diff-8312ad0561ef661716b48d09478362f3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/cwatson/brainGraph/commit/a2748e9880568d220b0670d082f56dbb3dbae8e6?short_path%3D8312ad0%23diff-8312ad0561ef661716b48d09478362f3&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792488214281000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2dGjYeBfKZG4Xu8UGK9r12\">Github</a>.<br><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Chris<br></div></div></div>\r\n"
    ]
